    "timeZone": "Europe/Paris",
    "description": "Paris is known as the ‘City of Love’, and on this love-themed tour, you’ll be able to discover the city’s most romantic places. After a hassle-free hotel pickup, you’ll travel in a stylish Citroën Traction vehicle with an open sunroof to enjoy the breeze.\r\n\r\nThe tour will begin with a ride through Montmartre – where you’ll pass the Wall of Love, the beautiful Sacré-Coeur basilica and Place du Tertre – which is known for being a place where artists set up their easels and paint.\r\n\r\nYou’ll continue the drive along the iconic Champs Elysées until you reach one of the city’s most romantic landmarks – the Eiffel Tower. As it's a private tour, your driver will be happy to help you with any custom requests, and will be able to drop you off at any central location in Paris.",
